Package: a2tp-dkms
Version: @VER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: dkms
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Maintainer: a2tp project
Description: a2tp kernel-mode L2 pseudowire (DKMS)
 a2tp ("another layer2 transport") Ethernet-over-UDP pseudowire with the
 whole data plane inside a loadable kernel module: server side mirrors and
 injects frames on a taken-over NIC via rx_handler, client side exposes a
 rtnl_link netdev. Wire format is identical to the userspace a2tp tools.
 .
 This package ships the module sources under /usr/src and registers them
 with DKMS (auto-rebuild on kernel updates), plus the a2tpctl control
 utility. No encryption/authentication: run it over a trusted network or
 layer WireGuard/IPsec on top.
